	<title>Adult Foreign Body Airway Obstruction Algorithm (AHA Step-by-Step)</title>
	<meta name="description" content="Follow the AHA adult foreign body airway obstruction algorithm: check severity, encourage coughing, activate EMS, then cycles of 5 back blows and 5 abdominal thrusts—or start CPR if the adult becomes unresponsive." />
