				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6848e62 elementor-section-stretched elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="6848e62" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e17fb4d" data-id="e17fb4d" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9fa2828 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="9fa2828" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4d9167e banner_title elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="4d9167e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">FAQs About Adult Foreign-Body Airway Obstruction Algorithm</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e607151 elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion" data-id="e607151" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;expanded&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}" data-widget_type="nested-accordion.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="e-n-accordion" aria-label="Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys">
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2410" class="e-n-accordion-item" open>
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="1" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2410" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><h3 class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Can a person still breathe after the object is removed? </h3></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2410" class="elementor-element elementor-element-0f2b926 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="0f2b926" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-99839fd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="99839fd" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									Yes, but they may still have a sore throat, coughing, or mild discomfort for a short time. If they have trouble breathing or swallowing after the object comes out, they should get medical care right away.								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2411" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="2" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2411" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><h3 class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> What foods are most likely to cause choking in adults? </h3></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2411" class="elementor-element elementor-element-526b081 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="526b081" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c3c51ff elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c3c51ff" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									Foods such as meat, hard candy, nuts, grapes, and large pieces of raw vegetables can increase the risk of choking. Cutting food into small pieces and chewing slowly can help prevent this emergency.								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2412" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="3" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2412" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><h3 class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Should I give the person water to help remove the object? </h3></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2412" class="elementor-element elementor-element-bbe8d9b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="bbe8d9b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f45d9ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="f45d9ae" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									No, do not give water or any other drink while the airway is blocked. Liquids can make choking worse and delay proper first aid.								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2413" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="4" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2413" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><h3 class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> How can I lower my risk of choking while eating? </h3></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2413" class="elementor-element elementor-element-5690be6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="5690be6" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d8dc53e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d8dc53e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									Take small bites, chew your food well, and avoid talking or laughing with food in your mouth. Eating slowly also gives you more time to swallow safely.								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2414" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="5" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2414" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><h3 class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Why is it important to learn choking first aid before an emergency happens? </h3></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2414" class="elementor-element elementor-element-33c55b2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="33c55b2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4aea5bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4aea5bf" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									Learning the correct steps ahead of time helps you stay calm and act quickly when someone is choking. Early action can save a life while waiting for emergency medical help to arrive.								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
